menu "Example Configuration"
    config EXAMPLE_SLEEP_TIME_MS
        int "Deep sleep time (ms)"
        default 1000
        range 1 86400000
        help
            Timer wakeup interval after one frame is captured.
            The unit is milliseconds. The timer starts when deep sleep begins.
            The full software AOV cycle is this interval plus camera init and capture time.

    config EXAMPLE_CT_MIN
        int "Minimum color temperature (K)"
        default 3000
        range 2000 20000
        help
            Cold boot keeps streaming until the IPA color temperature is at least this value.
            The saved state is what makes the first frame after the next wakeup usable.

    config EXAMPLE_CT_MAX
        int "Maximum color temperature (K)"
        default 8000
        range EXAMPLE_CT_MIN 20000
        help
            Cold boot keeps streaming until the IPA color temperature is at most this value.

    config EXAMPLE_CT_WAIT_MS
        int "Color temperature wait timeout (ms)"
        default 30000
        range 1000 300000
        help
            Give up this boot if color temperature is still outside the range after this time.
            The device does not save IPA state and does not enter deep sleep.

    config EXAMPLE_RECV_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "Frame receive timeout (ms)"
        default 1000
        range 10 60000
        help
            DQBUF timeout. During the cold-boot color-temperature wait, each DQBUF uses
            the smaller of this value and the remaining wait deadline.
endmenu
